 s and haunted scarecrows\, everyone's invited to bring their spookiest nig
 htmares to life for a frightfully fun celebration. ​ All parade particip
 ants and attendees are welcome to join in making Market Street a spooky an
 d f
LOCATION:York Fairgrounds\, York\, PA\, 17404
