 507655.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Columbia Democrats are looking for volunteers to greet voters 
 at the polls on **Election Day\, Tuesday\, Nov. 3**\, from open (7 AM) to 
 close (8 PM). Election security has been under constant fire from the curr
 ent administration. A visible\, friendly presence at the polls pushes back
  against that. When neighbors show up\, voters know they belong there and 
 their vote counts. ## Poll greeters will: - Welcome voters and hand out ca
 ndidate information - Answer basic questions\, like where to line up and w
LOCATION:Columbia\, Columbia\, PA\, 17512
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/1061919/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
